      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Part 1 of 3: Capture the lead and enrich it\n**AI Lead Intelligence and Qualification**\n\n1. Lead Capture Form: a public form. Whoever fills it in gives their name, work email, company, role, and what they want to solve. This is what starts the workflow.\n2. Normalize Lead: pulls the domain out of the work email and notes the exact time the form was submitted.\n3. Run an Actor and get dataset: runs an Apify actor, the Google AI Overviews Scraper, that asks Google's AI Overview to summarize the company using its name and domain. This replaced Apollo, same idea, a quick read on who the company is, just through Apify instead.\n\nAbout the credential: this node already shows a credential called 'Rahul's Apify account'. That is only a label though, n8n never puts the actual key inside a shared file, so you will still need to connect your own Apify account here. A free Apify account works fine for this.\n\nNext: import part 2 and connect Run an Actor and get dataset into Score Lead with AI.",
        "width": 760,
        "height": 380
      }
